st.\n- **FREE MR PUZZLE**: Once you start, you'll be hooked!\n\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)", "short_description": "Grab it, hold it, pull it out! An MR harvesting puzzle for everywhere!\n\nIn HickonuQ: The Rise of the Legendary Farmer, your bare hands pull vegetables from your living room, the park, the road and anywhere else they grow! Find the right moment and aim for the best harvest!\nThis MR action harvesting puzzle game is set in a real space!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HickonuQ_1080x360.png", "id": "3769886749993965", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974640_3769886753327298_7873851012123971987_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WHhgsTtu49wQ7kNvwH020Pu&_nc_oc=AdrOkiB1A9hLRP4r4AyhQxXSMpeWAdqzE-nRXDkeKb5RhwSpj_oaV7ek-FzyOvzTWOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCk7p1BvXGTJmH8ijimSeEbgOnsZvk73dTOH3QiTvcZeQ&oe=6A69EB1A"}, {"file_name": "HickonuQ_2560x1440.png", "id": "1286422819224822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974447_1286422822558155_924012105581734869_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YGBQuQxbLMUQ7kNvwF1UyQk&_nc_oc=AdqKf6xCA0BQIqKAy53LFrfJzFQMGnAftmrlG9dzFAosGC5H8OlzfcD2bfoRqBYa-xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAvP2lFM6L_91cqIbhByok9XAfddxCGdtHe8KoaDLusbA&oe=6A6A0F6D"}, {"file_name": "HickonuQ_9000x1440.png", "id": "1284631692891617", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031452_1284631696224950_1420600272098178709_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fdmo5AEuVgAQ7kNvwGe4Wy6&_nc_oc=Adr6UwvOOrNp7UPzYTmkOnSRwKRwBGo_YQO9PKdAxUPT-iljLEYO0u1SR0x8JAxpEmU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC8Pz1IGX8pMYO6WCMPIRhj46plrDyKe20TNpc5sBz7pg&oe=6A69FF97"}, {"file_name": "HickonuQ_1008x